 you"}]},experience:{active:!0,heading:"Destiny \u2013 The Farm Resort",desc:"Destiny is a resort unlike any other. It\u2019s here where different worlds come together. A working Farm. Premium, country-style hospitality, including delectable dining restaurants and an elegant conference hall. Horses. The vast wilderness of the Nilgiri biosphere. Mesmerising trails through beautiful woods. The serene Lake Emerald is home to myriad species of avifauna. And a Spa that faces the lake. In all, 125 acres of fresh air, calm and rejuvenation. At just a 1 hr 30 min drive (~25 km) away from Ooty.",items:[{img:"https://ourtourplannerpublic.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Fortune+Jammu/Digital+Menu.jpg",label:"DIGITAL MENUS",extLink:"",routerLink:"/by-admin/1948"},{img:"https://ourtourplannerpublic.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/pride-hotel/guest-review.jpg",label:"REVIEW & REWARD",extLink:"",routerLink:"/by-admin/1949"},{img:"https://ourtourplannerpublic.s3-ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/FortuneGrace/roomdining.jpg",label:"SPECIAL OFFERS & PROMOTIONS",extLink:"",routerLink:"/by-admin/1950"},{img:"https://ourtourplannerpublic.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Fortune+Jammu/Plan+Your+Trip.jpg",label:"DIGITAL CONCIERGE",extLink:"",routerLink:"/by-admin/1951"}]},destinations:{active:!0,heading:"In-House Experiences",desc:"Destiny offers a plethora of fun and engaging activities that make for an unforgettable vacation \u2013 one marked by inspiring moments of discovery, adventure, learning and gorgeous views.",items:[{img:"https://ourtourplannerpublic.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Little-Earth/Destiny/Horse-riding1.avif",name:"Horse Riding",location:"",views:"",routerLink:"/stores/HorseRiding_1",extLink:""},{img:"https://ourtourplannerpublic.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Little-Earth/Destiny/Farms1.avif",name:"Guided Tour of the Farms and Farm Animals",location:"",views:"",routerLink:"/stores/GuidedTouroftheFarmsandFarmAnimals",extLink:""},{img:"https://ourtourplannerpublic.s3.ap-s